      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Department of War is focusing on engineering excellence, military operations, logistics, technology, leadership, and cybersecurity. Promotions and training updates are also highlighted. The Department of War is particularly noted for its role in defense operations and support, including the deployment of a Voyager tanker to protect Saudi Arabia&#39;s airspace.</description>
